(7. Beneficial Ownership Identification: For corporate entities, the beneficial owner is the natural person who ultimately) Tj
T*
(owns or controls a controlling ownership interest, defined as holding more than ten percent of shares or capital or profits.) Tj
T*
(8. Threshold for Partnerships and Trusts: For partnership firms and unincorporated associations, the beneficial ownership threshold) Tj
T*
(is fifteen percent \(15 percent\) of capital or profits. For trusts, the author of the trust, the trustee, and beneficiaries holding) Tj
T*
(fifteen percent or more interest must be identified and verified.) Tj
T*
(9. Cross-Border Wire Transfers: All cross-border wire transfers exceeding rupees fifty thousand \(INR 50,000\) or equivalent shall) Tj
T*
(carry complete originator and beneficiary information, including name, account number, and unique customer identification number.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
